## A note on FFmpeg

Earlier versions of this file read *"FFmpeg and related DLLs may be subject to
LGPL. Include third-party license notices here."* That was a Windows-era
placeholder. **This Linux port does not use FFmpeg**; MP3 encoding is the
vendored LAME described above, and FLAC and WAV are encoded by this project's
own code. The line was removed on 2026-08-24 because naming a dependency that
does not exist, while omitting the one that does, is worse than saying nothing.

