## Rust dependencies

The remaining dependencies are permissively licensed (MIT/Apache-2.0). Generate
a full inventory with:

    cargo install cargo-about   # or cargo-deny
    cargo about generate about.hbs

Regenerate that inventory before any public release; this section is a pointer,
not a substitute for it.

